WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.610
Flying a real drone
at Brophy takes two things.

2
00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:05.320
Get certified once.

3
00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:08.010
Then ask before every flight.

4
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.820
The Brophy Drone Certification
has four parts.

5
00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:15.580
FAA TRUST, a free federal safety test.

6
00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:18.340
Safe Flight, a video and a quiz.

7
00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:22.380
The Pilot Agreement,
signed by you and a parent or guardian.

8
00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:26.590
And your Drone Portfolio,
the drones the club has seen you fly.

9
00:00:27.067 --> 00:00:29.667
It takes about 45 minutes at home.

10
00:00:29.707 --> 00:00:33.827
You send photos of TRUST and the
agreement, and a mentor checks them.

11
00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:36.437
Certification never expires.

12
00:00:36.933 --> 00:00:38.493
Your own drone?

13
00:00:38.533 --> 00:00:40.223
Add a minute of flight video.

14
00:00:40.293 --> 00:00:42.063
A mentor approves it.

15
00:00:43.433 --> 00:00:44.513
No drone?

16
00:00:44.553 --> 00:00:45.873
Fly the club's.

17
00:00:45.913 --> 00:00:51.123
Finish TRUST, Safe Flight and the
agreement, plus the five Tier 0 badges.

18
00:00:51.193 --> 00:00:54.473
Then fly the club Meteor
while a mentor watches:

19
00:00:54.513 --> 00:00:58.003
a figure eight through two gates,
an orbit, a landing.

20
00:00:58.153 --> 00:01:00.963
Pass, and the Meteor joins your portfolio.

21
00:01:01.033 --> 00:01:02.483
You're certified.

22
00:01:02.967 --> 00:01:05.007
Certified says you can fly.

23
00:01:05.047 --> 00:01:07.087
It never says you may.

24
00:01:07.127 --> 00:01:09.807
Every campus flight needs
a yes on the school's flight

25
00:01:09.847 --> 00:01:13.327
request form,
filed at least 24 hours ahead.

26
00:01:13.367 --> 00:01:15.457
No answer means no.

27
00:01:15.933 --> 00:01:20.503
Fly only what you filed:
that time, place and drone.

28
00:01:20.733 --> 00:01:23.063
Own drone: a spotter you name.

29
00:01:23.213 --> 00:01:26.053
Club drone: a mentor and a spotter.

30
00:01:26.093 --> 00:01:28.583
The simulators never need a form.

31
00:01:29.167 --> 00:01:33.817
Open the Flight Clearance
page and start with FAA TRUST.

